  emptyColor: {r: 1, g: 0.31, b: 0.64, a: 1}
  tutorialIntro: 'Three years ago you went out for milk.

    You never came back.


    She
    kept the house. You got the trailer next door

    and an ice cream truck that
    BIG DAIRY owns.


    Your kid is coming over. Make some ice cream.'
  lessonNames:
  - Scoop up some mud
  - Climb in the truck
  - Churn the mud
  - Scoop a cone
  - Serve your kid
  - Churn strawberries
  - Churn some nuts
  - Take the wheel
  dayIntros:
  - 'Meanwhile, at your ex''s house...

    Your kid asked who the guy in the truck
    is.

    Your ex said "nobody, sweetie."'
  - 'Meanwhile, at your ex''s house...

    The kids made a video about you.

    It
    has four views. All yours.'
  - 'Big Dairy sent a fruit basket.

    It''s all milk.'
  - 'Final installment.

    Your ex says she''s "cautiously curious."

    Don''t
    blow this.'
  - 'Overtime.

    Big Dairy charges interest in milk.'
