    <color=#ffe14a>4</color>  every upgrade

    <color=#ffe14a>5</color> 
    fill the minigun hopper

    <color=#ffe14a>6</color>  repair the truck

    <color=#ffe14a>7</color> 
    skip to the next part of the day

    <color=#ffe14a>8</color>  clear strikes
    and heat

    <color=#ffe14a>9</color>  truck to Big Dairy''s lot'
